    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "33\nCHINA AIRWAYS FEDERAL INC. U.S. A.\nCABLE ADDRESS: \"AVIEXPLOR\"\n3 CANTON ROAD\nErday March 24H\nNORTH AMERICAN AVIATION, INC.\nSHANGHAI\nWRIGHT AERONAUTICAL CORPORATION\nINTERCONTINENT AVIATION, INC.\nCURTISS-WRIGHT AIRPLANE COMPANY\nCURTISS WRIGHT CORPORATION\nDOUGLAS AIRCRAFT COMPANY\nCURTISS AEROPLANE AND MOTOR COMPANY\nSPERRY GYROSCOPE COMPANY\nDearest Arbs.\nDid not write to you yetuday breaun\n- and then laot night want\nI got swampd\nout wit mas Poein and some of his frends to\nlay poker - our host. mame was St. Louis. he\nis a French Canadian - 20 9 fret quite at\nhome.\nHas a buoy day and played poker\nMate 1:30 Q.M. At fust I won all the\nand was true, embarand but after\nmoney\nthat I played\nI played along in torry hand and\nabont rown. They wine\nfinally ended up\nseen in all, and in\na free of fun.\nHair had a buoy day\nwhich\nwish o could with you all\nabout and mayh wile hav a chane\ntomorrow, but tonight must hung up\nAnd get off some cables then go to the\nCept butchins for deaner. She is just\nback fom Ou\nwhers she stayed\nSAVE ®\nTIME",
      "with the C.O. Of the U.S. marine guard, so\nmay had some news.\nAn inclosing a handkuchef which\nI hops you will liker. Miss Forts bought\nthem for me\nand I'm gong to takes\na chaner mailing them to you one\nat a time, remembering tkat you\nuna to\nget\nthem from traver that\nway\nThere should\nnot t2 am, cut,\nanyway as none cost as muck as\nyes goed - evich sem is duts burie\nor at least so 9 am advind.\nsand one rach to Bo and Francho a\nmayor to horta and Bid. Let me\nknow what you think of them\nbuy a asap. bange 4 for?\ngoed - u\nTie sand some to Rut, Strea, etc.\nhots and lot of lour dearnt-\n2019121.0616"
    ],
